  "grammar_notes": [
    "Guten Tag contains the weak masculine accusative adjective form guten in a fixed greeting.",
    "Wie geht’s? contracts geht es; the phrase is an everyday greeting.",
    "Die Freundin is the feminine nominative subject in the question with heißt.",
    "Die Frage is a feminine accusative direct object of verstehe; nicht negates the verb phrase."
